From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:57:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamBluray: map MVC playlists to title time

MVC playlists stay on raw clip time, since the dependent view is read
from its own file and pairs with the base view by exact timestamp. In
navigation mode the bytes that start a new item go to the demuxer being
closed.
